# OPS-332 Gap #6: code-owner gating on production / secret-management paths.
#
# Forgejo (Gitea-derived) honors CODEOWNERS at .gitea/CODEOWNERS, docs/,
# or repo root. Pairs with the branch-protection rule on `main` having
# "Require approval from code owners" enabled.
#
# Pattern syntax follows GitHub CODEOWNERS:
#   <path-pattern> <user-or-team> <user-or-team>...
# Last matching pattern wins. @koiakoia is the operator account.
#
# NIST controls: AC-5 (Separation of Duties), CM-3(4) (Configuration
# Change Control — Restrict Changes), SA-15 (Development Process).

# --- Production cluster manifests ---
# clusters/overwatch/ is the canonical source-of-truth for the
# production OKD cluster's ArgoCD Applications + cluster-config.
# Any change here ripples through every app on the cluster.
clusters/overwatch/**            @koiakoia

# --- Cluster-scoped policy + admission control ---
# Kyverno ClusterPolicies define what's admissible. Loosening these is
# always a posture change.
apps/kyverno-policies/**         @koiakoia
apps/kyverno/**                  @koiakoia

# --- Secret-management infrastructure ---
# ExternalSecret CRDs, ClusterSecretStore configuration, and any secret
# that mounts into a cluster workload.
apps/external-secrets/**         @koiakoia
**/external-secret*.yaml         @koiakoia
**/externalsecret*.yaml          @koiakoia

# --- Mesh ingress + routing ---
# Gateway hosts list, VirtualService changes that re-route public
# hostnames, AuthorizationPolicy changes.
apps/mesh-config/**              @koiakoia

# --- Supply-chain trust ---
# trust-policy.yaml, signature verification config, Harbor pull-secret
# manifests, the few places where signing trust is defined.
**/trust-policy*.yaml            @koiakoia
**/cosign-pubkey*.yaml           @koiakoia
apps/harbor/**                   @koiakoia

# --- The CODEOWNERS file itself ---
# So nobody can quietly relax the gating without operator review.
/.gitea/CODEOWNERS               @koiakoia
